  <h1>How Much Does a New Boiler Actually Cost?</h1>
  <p>This is the question everyone wants a straight answer to, and fair enough — it's a big purchase. Here's what genuinely affects the price, and roughly what to expect.</p>

  <h2>Typical prices for our jobs</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Like-for-like combi swap:</strong> from £2,000</li>
    <li><strong>System-to-combi conversion:</strong> from £3,000</li>
    <li>Most jobs fall in the £2,000–£3,000 range depending on the work involved</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What actually changes the price</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Like-for-like vs conversion</strong> — swapping the same type of boiler for a newer version is the cheapest option; changing the type (say, system to combi) means more pipework.</li>
    <li><strong>Boiler size and brand</strong> — we fit Worcester Bosch and Ideal; both have a range of models at different price points depending on your home's hot water demand.</li>
    <li><strong>Where the boiler is, and where it's going</strong> — moving the boiler to a new location costs more than swapping it in the same spot.</li>
    <li><strong>Extra work uncovered on the day</strong> — old, worn pipework or an undersized system sometimes needs attention alongside the boiler itself. We'll always tell you before doing anything unquoted.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why the cheapest quote isn't always the best one</h2>
  <p>A very low quote often means a smaller boiler than your home actually needs, a shorter warranty, or corners cut on the install itself — and a badly sized or badly fitted boiler costs you more over its lifetime in efficiency and repairs. We'll size it properly for your home the first time.</p>

  <h2>What's included in our price</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Free home visit and quote</li>
    <li>Written proposal with clear pricing — no surprises on the day</li>
    <li>{siteConfig.warranty} workmanship warranty, plus the manufacturer's boiler warranty</li>
    <li>Gas Safe certificate and warranty registration handled for you</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Deposit required on jobs over £400 (set out in your written quote); balance due within 7 days of completion.</p>
